# EMB's gaps (Tour level 7, phase 25; data gaps.json), each set up with a teleport:
# - EMB SEVEN (600, air): taken off on the terrace, over the middle of the seven stairs (a band across
#   them), down on the plaza, 40 ticks of air at least. An ollie down the set; rolled off the terrace at
#   6.5 m/s it flies the set too (54 ticks of air): paid. Rolled off at 3 m/s it bumps down the steps
#   (27-29 ticks each): no gap.
# - FOUNTAIN GAP (400, air): from the plaza east of the fountain over its east rim, down in the pool, 40
#   ticks of air at least (a teleport's drop into the pool kept the last takeoff and paid it). An ollie
#   on the pool floor beside the rim, 107 ticks of air, does not cross it: no gap.
# - THREE BLOCK (300, grind): an edge of the three stacked blocks by the fountain (a boardslide here);
#   it replaces EMB LEDGE, the plaza's ledges.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport 562.56 694.85 -7.85 70.8
cmd 3 set skater.vel.x 5.3291
cmd 3 set skater.vel.y 1.8558
cmd 401 teleport 563.5 696 -7.85 60
cmd 403 set skater.vel.x 2.5981
cmd 403 set skater.vel.y 1.5000
cmd 801 teleport 562.5 695.2 -7.85 60
cmd 803 set skater.vel.x 5.6292
cmd 803 set skater.vel.y 3.2500
cmd 1201 teleport 620.91 731.44 -8.85 268.1
cmd 1203 set skater.vel.x -5.1472
cmd 1203 set skater.vel.y -0.1707
cmd 1601 teleport 608.5 728.5 -9.75 75
cmd 1603 set skater.vel.x 2.8978
cmd 1603 set skater.vel.y 0.7765
cmd 2001 teleport 615.42 675.24 -9.25 257
cmd 2003 set skater.vel.x -5.3883
cmd 2003 set skater.vel.y -1.2440
hold left 2103..2110
hold right 2066..2073
hold ollie 55..65
hold ollie 1258..1280
hold ollie 1615..1640
hold ollie 2025..2035
tap grind 2037
tap grind 2043
tap grind 2049
tap grind 2055
tap grind 2061
run 2400
